<title>USA: TENNIS-HILTON HEAD ISLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HILTON HEAD ISLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HILTON HEAD ISLAND, South Carolina 1997-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from $926,250 Family Circle Cup women's tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat 11-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>12-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Sandra Dopfer (Austria) 6-0</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Gala Leon Carcia (Spain) beat Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand)</p>
<p>6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Mariaan de Swardt (South Africa) beat Natasha Zvereva</p>
<p>(Belarus) 6-4 2-1 retired</p>
<p>Lisa Raymond (U.S.) beat Linda Wild (U.S.) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Katarina Studenikova</p>
<p>(Slovakia) 5-7 7-6 (7-2) 6-4</p>
<p>Virginia Ruano-Pascual (Spain) beat Patricia Hy-Boulais</p>
<p>(Canada) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>4-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Shi-Ting Wang (Taiwan) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>5-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Olga Barabanschikova</p>
<p>(Belarus) 6-7 (3-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Cristina Torrens-Valero</p>
<p>(Spain) 7-6 (7-4) 6-4</p>
<p>:</p>
<p>Add second round</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Barbara Rittner (Germany)</p>
<p>6-0 6-4</p>
</text>
